{
  "id": 8834397372615,
  "title": "Personalized Basketball Player Front Blanket with Name and Number",
  "handle": "personalized-basketball-player-front-blanket-with-name-and-number-258e7f9e2e-258e7f9e2e",
  "body_html": "<p>Celebrate your passion for the game with a custom sports blanket from Jeminise. This personalized basketball player blanket is designed for true basketball lovers, featuring a dynamic athlete design and fully customizable options to make it uniquely yours. Whether you are wrapping up on the couch to watch your favorite team, relaxing in bed, or looking for a thoughtful sports gift, this cozy blanket offers the perfect blend of warmth, comfort, and personalized style.</p>\n<h3>Key Features</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Personalized Design:</strong> Customize your blanket with your own selected Name and Number for a one-of-a-kind sports keepsake.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Soft &amp; Cozy Materials:</strong> Crafted with two high-quality polyester layers, available in super-soft Fleece or warm Sherpa fabric options.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Multiple Sizes Available:</strong> Choose the perfect fit from four distinct sizes: Small (40x30 inches), Medium (50x40 inches), Large (60x50 inches), or X-Large (80x60 inches).</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Versatile Use:</strong> Perfect for both indoor and outdoor activities, including lounging on the sofa, extra bedroom warmth, traveling, camping, or picnics.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Easy Care:</strong> Machine washable in cold water; dries quickly on low heat or air dry to maintain its fluffy texture.</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Product Specifications</h3>\n<table>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<th>Brand</th>\n<td>Jeminise</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Product Type</th>\n<td>Blanket</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Material</th>\n<td>Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Fabric Type</th>\n<td>Fleece/Sherpa</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Selected Design</th>\n<td>Basketball Blanket 13</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Theme</th>\n<td>Basketball, Game</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Pattern</th>\n<td>Basketball</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Blanket Form</th>\n<td>Travel Blanket</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Customization</th>\n<td>2 text inputs (Name and Number)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Available Sizes</th>\n<td>Small (40x30 inches) | Medium (50x40 inches) | Large (60x50 inches) | X-Large (80x60 inches)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Special Feature</th>\n<td>Lightweight, Breathable, Tear Resistant</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Seasons</th>\n<td>Winter / All Seasons</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Care Instructions</th>\n<td>Machine Wash</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>",
